abstract: >-
  FightSafe AI v1.0.0 research software and canonical reproducibility artefact for the
  EAAI manuscript “Engineering an Interpretable Temporal Event Pipeline with Explicit
  Channel Availability: A Combat-Sports Case Study”. The GitHub repository is the official
  package: Tier A verification and regeneration of reported tables and figures from frozen
  canonical result files (run_20260730_005150), configs, aggregation schemes with explicit
  availability masking, environment metadata and checksums. Not a safety-certified system;
  not a state-of-the-art detector claim; not a medical device. Synthetic missingness only.
